== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Rancid remains|Aggressive creature strategies#Rancid remains}}

=== Mace ===
Swings their mace sideways in a 2.2-meter 70-degree horizontal arc (20 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] and 30 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage). This attack can be used every 3 seconds when within 2.2 meters of a player.

